@startuml
title No-Injection Boundary
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Guest chunks + structural holes" as Source #FEF3C7
rectangle "Token lattice\nHoleId is a terminal" as Parse #DBEAFE
rectangle "Scoped template" as Hole #DCFCE7
rectangle "Host binding\nas scoped FLT value" as Value #E0E7FF
rectangle "Handle · category · telescope\ncapability check" as Check #A7F3D0
rectangle "Capture-avoiding substitution" as Graft #DCFCE7
rectangle "Final scoped guest term" as Result #DCFCE7
rectangle "Rendered text attack\nclosing delimiter / separator" as Attack #FEE2E2

Source --> Parse : never concatenate
Parse --> Hole : WPDA result
Value --> Check : structured value only
Check --> Graft : same handle or verified morphism
Hole --> Graft : exact HoleId occurrence
Graft --> Result : preserve outer structure
Attack -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Parse : rejected · never tokenized as a fill

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Guest source template |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Structural token boundary |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Scoped guest syntax |
  |<#E0E7FF> | Structured host binding |
  |<#A7F3D0> | Fail-closed type/capability gate |
  |<#FEE2E2> | Rejected text attack |
endlegend
@enduml
